meta {
  name: Get Curriculum Pack By ID
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/packs/{{packId}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

tests {
  test("returns the full Curriculum Pack definition", function() {
    expect(res.status).to.equal(200);
    expect(res.body.pack.id).to.be.a("string");
    expect(res.body.pack.cards).to.be.an("array");
  });
}

docs {
  # GET /api/v1/packs/:packId (`getCurriculumPackById`)

  Retrieves the latest **Pack Version** of a **Curriculum Pack** by its `packId` (defaults to `{{packId}}` = `diabe-teach`), including its `boardConfig`, **Semantic Domains**, **Keyword Cards**, **Adjudication Rubric**, assessment instrument, and perception survey.

  - Without an instructor **Capability Token**, MCQ `correctOptionIndex` and `explanation` fields are redacted (`null`) so learners cannot inspect the answer key.
  - With `Authorization: Bearer {{instructorToken}}`, the unredacted answer key is included.

  ## Responses & Error Codes (`ApiErrorCode`)
  - **`200 OK`**: Full `CurriculumPack` object.
  - **`401 UNAUTHORIZED_TOKEN`**: Invalid or wrong-kind bearer token when an `Authorization` header is supplied.
  - **`404 PACK_NOT_FOUND`**: No Curriculum Pack exists with `packId`.
}
